<title>USA: BOK Financial municipal bond unit approved.</title>
<headline>BOK Financial municipal bond unit approved.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOK Financial Corp on Tuesday said it was granted approval to form Alliance Securities Corp, a securities firm specializing in municipal bonds.</p>
<p>The Federal Reserve approved the subsidiary's formation on Monday, the bank holding company said.</p>
<p>The unit, with an initial capitalization of $5 million, will specialize in providing finance and underwriting services to Oklahoma municipal bond issuers, BOK Financial said.</p>
<p>Shares of BOK were up two at 31-1/4 Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
